@startuml
title SplitSmart Logical Components

actor "Group Member" as Member

component "Web Customer Product\n(client technology TBD)" as Web
component "Java Swing MVP\n(separate prototype)" as Swing
component "Application Operations\n(integration contract TBD)" as App
component "Domain Rules\n(expenses, approvals, balances)" as Domain
database "Persistent Records\n(storage technology TBD)" as Store
component "Notifications\n(channel TBD)" as Notify
component "Reports" as Reports

Member --> Web
Member --> Swing
Web --> App : user actions
Swing --> App : user actions
App --> Domain : execute rules
Domain --> Store : read/write domain records
App --> Notify : expense created
App --> Reports : requested summaries
Reports --> Store : authorized records

note right of Web
Required customer product.
Must not be replaced by Swing.
end note

note right of Swing
Desktop MVP prototype only;
not customer-platform compliant.
end note

note bottom of App
Service deployment and client protocol
are not specified by the source documents.
end note
@enduml
